# General App: settings of its own, on top of firmware/sdkconfig.defaults (shared by every app).
# A machine app puts here what makes it that machine, for example:
#   CONFIG_HMI_MACHINE_NAME="Packing line 2"
#   CONFIG_HMI_DEMO_DATA=n
#   CONFIG_ECAT_PATH=y          (two-axis interpolation in CSP)
# The General App keeps every default.
